<title>USA: Group of Purus holders disbands.</title>
<headline>Group of Purus holders disbands.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group of Swiss investors holding a 26.4 percent stake in Purus Inc said Thursday it is no longer acting as a group now that its previous demands of the company have been met.</p>
<p>The group's members, including Peter Friedli of Zurich, said in a U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission filing that they were dissolving the group because they had &quot;accomplished their desired results.&quot;</p>
<p>Among its requests had been a reduction in the number of Purus directors and a rethinking of a cash distribution proposal that has since been rescinded.</p>
</text>
